# Deciduous decision-graph exports: regenerated by `deciduous sync` (and the
# pre-commit hook) on every commit. They must stay committed — GitHub Pages
# serves the graph viewer from /docs — but their diffs carry no reviewable
# information. `linguist-generated` collapses them in PR diffs and excludes
# them from diff stats; `-diff` keeps local `git diff` output to one line.
docs/graph-data.json linguist-generated=true -diff
docs/git-history.json linguist-generated=true -diff
